	StudioGUI Creator v1.7 — WYSIWYG GUI Editor for Roblox (executor LocalScript)
	NEW IN v1.7
	• Resizable 4-panel layout: panels sit as [] [] split by a draggable |
	  (left/right widths) plus a | between stacked panels in each column;
	  drag left/right to grow/shrink the panel next to it.
	• AI auto-recovery: on HTTP/think failure it runs switch-models then
	  continue-task automatically (mid-task too), with cross-provider fallback.
	• Code Mode agent backend (OpenCode-style: model writes Luau tool code,
	  sandbox executes it) as fallback when native tool-calling is unsupported.
	• NVIDIA NIM preset + any OpenAI-compatible endpoint; robust request
	  lifecycle (timeout watchdog, generation tokens, history sanitizer) that
	  fixes the HTTP request / "think" failure after 2+ AI responses.
	• /commands: /help /switch-model /continue /stop /agent /codemode
	  /autoswitch /model /clear
============================================================================]]
